<h1>two-level grid file</h1>
<p>
(data structure)
</p>

<p>
<strong>Definition:</strong>
A <a href="pointAccessMethod.html"><em>point access method</em></a> which is two levels of  <a href="gridfile.html"><em>grid files</em></a>.  The first level addresses second level grid files.
</p>


<p>
<em>Note:
After <a href="../terms.html#GG98">[GG98]</a>.</em>
</p>

<p>Author: <a href="../Other/contrib.html#authorPEB">PEB</a></p>

<hr>

Go to the
<a href="https://www.nist.gov/dads/">Dictionary of Algorithms and Data
Structures</a> home page.

